he first week also included testing and research, and that submissions were suspended in the second week. The excerpt instead presents the periods as alternating between accepting applications and reserved research/testing/processing time, obscuring that overlap and the pause in submissions. The narrative repeats the same simplified framing.","materiality":"Material: it changes the description of the private-beta work rhythm, a central detail of the piece."},{"excerpt":"De werkwijze van het POA-refundteam combineerde zo een focus op aanvragers in de eerste fase met expliciet gereserveerde tijd voor onderzoek en testen tijdens de private beta.","claim":"The team’s approach combined an early focus on applicants with explicitly reserved time for research and testing during private beta.","category":"interpretation","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"My team focused on the users applying for refunds first and this is what we took to the alpha assessment.","narrative":"De beschreven aanpak combineerde een volgorde waarin aanvragers eerst kwamen met expliciet gereserveerde tijd voor onderzoek en testen.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"This summarizes two source-supported practices without asserting that either caused the launch or any outcome.","materiality":"Material summary of the approach, accurately represented."}]}

